WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.087
Do you own a plot of land or property.
but find it difficult to visit regularly?

2
00:00:06.187 --> 00:00:12.275
Perhaps you live in another city.
Maybe work. distance. or a busy schedule keeps you away.

3
00:00:12.375 --> 00:00:17.321
But being away shouldn't mean being unaware
of what's happening at your property.

4
00:00:17.421 --> 00:00:21.606
Introducing PROPERTY SCREEN.
Your trusted partner for periodic. on-ground property screening.

5
00:00:21.706 --> 00:00:29.695
Here's how we help. Once you register your property
and choose a visit schedule. our field representative visits your site physically.

6
00:00:29.795 --> 00:00:34.361
During every scheduled visit. we observe
the visible condition of your property.

7
00:00:34.461 --> 00:00:40.548
We check the surroundings. access points. visible boundary markers.
overgrowth. dumping. and signs of unusual activity.

8
00:00:40.648 --> 00:00:45.594
We capture photographs. document our observations.
and prepare a clear property visit report.

9
00:00:45.694 --> 00:00:54.064
Your report is then shared with you. so you can see what was observed
without travelling all the way to your property.

10
00:00:54.164 --> 00:01:01.773
Whether you own one plot or multiple properties.
PROPERTY SCREEN helps you stay informed. even when life keeps you away.

11
00:01:01.873 --> 00:01:09.863
Please remember. our service provides periodic physical screening
and visual updates. It is not continuous surveillance or a guarantee against encroachment.

12
00:01:09.963 --> 00:01:16.050
PROPERTY SCREEN.
Your Property Is Never Out of Sight.
Stay informed. Stay connected. Stay in view.
